1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,662
Logic puzzle tip number two:
reading the clues.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,218
Every clue is a fact you can
mark on the grid.

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:12,458
Start with the clues that say
what is NOT true. They give
you easy X's.

4
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:17,026
When only one square is left
in a row, it has to be the O.

5
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:21,236
What you learn in one grid
carries across to the others.

6
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:25,112
Put it to the test at
thelogicgrid.com!

